        "original_id": "2113fae3-deea-5324-87f6-b2eeeadd2f59",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Eddie Leonski, Mary Charleston, Slim Dusty, Joy McKean, Jon Blake, Rob Stewart\n- Products: Death of a Soldier, The Slim Dusty Movie, Prisoner, The Last Outlaw\n- Places: Melbourne, Australia\n- Topics: Australian film, serial killers\n\nFacts:\n- Edward Joseph Leonski was born on December 12, 1917, and died on November 9, 1942.\n- Eddie Leonski was an American soldier and serial killer who strangled three women in Melbourne, Australia.\n- The Slim Dusty Movie is a 1984 Australian feature film directed by Rob Stewart and starring Slim Dusty, Joy McKean, Jon Blake, and Mary Charleston.\n- Death of a Soldier is a 1986 Australian film based on the life of American serial killer Eddie Leonski.\n- Mary Charleston guest starred on television films and series during the 1970s and early 1980s.\n- Mary Charleston is best remembered for playing Linda Goldman in the cult soap opera Prisoner.\n- Mary Charleston appeared in the 1980 television miniseries The Last Outlaw.\n- Mary Charleston appeared in the 1986 war film Death of a Soldier.",
